    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nO'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers are delighted to offer for sale this excellent first-floor apartment situated right by the promenade in the sought-after Salthill location of Galway City. \n\nArasain Na Mara is a well-managed apartment complex with lift access & underground parking. \n\nThe complex is ideally situated on the doorstep of Salthill promenade. Arasain Na Mara also benefits greatly by local amenities that Salthill has to offer & is within walking distance of Galway City. \n\nNo.13 Arasain Na Mara is a spacious two-bedroom apartment situated on the first floor of the secure residential complex. \n\nComprising approximately 64 sq.m, this beautiful apartment is presented in excellent condition, having been upgraded throughout by current owner. \n\nThe condition is evident immediately with upgraded radiators, new flooring, as well as modern bathroom & kitchen fittings. \n\nWith accommodation comprising of two spacious bedrooms, both with fitted wardrobes & one availing of bay views, a modern main bathroom, and an open-plan reception area with kitchen unit & access to a private balcony. \n\nThis property also benefits from its own designated underground parking spot and storage unit.\n\nSituated right in the sought-after Salthill locale, Arasain Na Mara is within close proximity to several popular landmarks, including being adjacent to Salthill Village & Promenade, close proximity to Blackrock diving tower, Galway Lawn Tennis Club & Galway Golf Club, as well as being within walking distance to Galway City Centre, the popular West End & the vibrant Latin Quarter. \n\n13 Arasain Na Mara is an ideal property for all purchasers due to the well-proportioned accommodation on offer, excellent condition & ideal location in one of Galway's most popular residential areas. \n\nViewing is highly recommended.\n\nProperties can be viewed on our website www.odj.ie \n\nKeep up to-date with NEW PROPERTIES by registering your details on our database.\n\nFor Further details please contact O'Donnellan & Joyce on 091-564212 \nOFFICE OPENING HOURS - MON TO FRI 9AM TO 5:30PM\n\nNOTE: These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer. They are for information only and give a general idea of the property. They are not to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract, nor to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact.\n\nFLOORPLANS: The floor plan including furniture, fixture measurements and dimensions are approximate and for illustrative purposes only. The Polycam App used gives no guarantee, warranty or representation as to the accuracy and layout. All enquiries must be directed to the agent.\n\nWhilst every care is taken in their preparation, neither O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars.\n\nNo person in the employment of O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      },
